@startuml
title The factory inspection — stage by stage
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequence {
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #F3EEFB
  ParticipantBorderColor #7A5BB5
  ArrowColor #7A5BB5
  LifeLineBorderColor #7A5BB5
  NoteBackgroundColor #F3EEFB
  NoteBorderColor #7A5BB5
}

participant "Inspector\n(the verifier)" as I
participant "Manager\n(the prover)" as M

I -> M : is this chocolate bar the right one?
M -> I : yes, and here is what the stage above produced
note over I, M #F3EEFB: they play the cookie game on that stage
I -> I : the question shrinks to one machine in the stage above
I -> I : the line trick turns two questions back into one

I -> M : now prove that one machine
M -> I : here is what the stage above that produced
note over I, M #F3EEFB: they play the cookie game again

... one round of the game per stage of the factory ...

note over I #F3EEFB
  last stage: the raw ingredients
  the inspector brought them herself,
  so she checks this one on her own
  accept / reject
end note
@enduml
